ostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-san-pham-vali-768x768.jpg 768w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-san-pham-vali-320x320.jpg 320w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-san-pham-vali-25x25.jpg 25w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-san-pham-vali-650x650.jpg 650w" sizes="(max-width: 1070px) 100vw, 1070px" title="3 c&aacute;ch ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng r&#7845;t &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n &ndash; HThao Studio"><p id="caption-attachment-11116" class="wp-caption-text">Ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m Vali tr&ecirc;n n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng</p></div><br><div id="attachment_11117" style="width: 1010px" class="wp-caption alignnone"><img decoding="async" aria-describedby="caption-attachment-11117" class="size-full wp-image-11117" src="https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar.jpg" alt="chup anh guitar - 3 c&aacute;ch ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng r&#7845;t &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n &ndash; HThao Studio" width="1000" height="1000" srcset="https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar.jpg 1000w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar-300x300.jpg 300w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar-768x768.jpg 768w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar-320x320.jpg 320w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar-25x25.jpg 25w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/chup-anh-guitar-650x650.jpg 650w" sizes="(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" title="3 c&aacute;ch ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng r&#7845;t &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n &ndash; HThao Studio"><p id="caption-attachment-11117" class="wp-caption-text">Ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m guitar concept ph&ocirc;ng tr&#417;n</p></div><h2 style="text-align: justify;"><span id="1_Danh_den_vao_background_de_nen_sang_trang"><strong><img decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-13658" src="https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min.jpg" alt="Ao quan 2D 7 min - 3 c&aacute;ch ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng r&#7845;t &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n &ndash; HThao Studio" width="1500" height="1500" srcset="https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min.jpg 1500w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-300x300.jpg 300w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-150x150.jpg 150w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-768x768.jpg 768w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-320x320.jpg 320w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-1170x1170.jpg 1170w, https://hthaostudio.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Ao-quan-2D-7-min-585x585.jpg 585w" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" title="3 c&aacute;ch ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng r&#7845;t &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n &ndash; HThao Studio">#1 &#272;&aacute;nh &#273;&egrave;n v&agrave;o background &#273;&#7875; n&#7873;n s&aacute;ng tr&#7855;ng</strong></span></h2><p style="text-align: justify;">&#272;&#7875; c&oacute; m&#7897;t n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng tuy&#7879;t &#273;&#7889;i ngay khi ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh l&agrave; m&#7897;t &#273;i&#7873;u kh&ocirc;ng h&#7873; &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n, b&#7903;i v&igrave; c&aacute;c y&#7871;u t&#7889; m&ocirc;i tr&#432;&#7901;ng xung quanh c&oacute; th&#7875; &#7843;nh h&#432;&#7903;ng t&#7899;i White Balance, do &#273;&oacute; th&#7921;c t&#7871; ph&ocirc;ng n&#7873;n sau khi ch&#7909;p th&#432;&#7901;ng c&oacute; m&agrave;u x&aacute;m ho&#7863;c kh&ocirc;ng th&#7875; tr&#7855;ng tinh.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">C&oacute; 1 c&aacute;ch &#273;&#7875; cho n&#7873;n tr&#7903; n&ecirc;n tr&#7855;ng tinh &#273;&oacute; l&agrave; b&#7841;n setup &#273;&egrave;n &#273;&aacute;nh v&agrave;o background. Background ph&#7843;i l&agrave; n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng v&agrave; t&#7845;m mica trong l&#7851;n v&agrave;o nhau. Khi &aacute;nh s&aacute;ng &#273;&aacute;nh m&#7841;nh v&agrave;o th&igrave; highlight s&#7869; l&ecirc;n cao v&agrave; t&#7921; nhi&ecirc;n n&#7873;n s&#7869; tr&#7903; n&ecirc;n s&aacute;ng ch&aacute;y =&gt; T&#7913;c l&agrave; m&agrave;u n&#7873;n s&#7869; l&agrave; tr&#7855;ng tinh nh&#7901; &aacute;nh s&aacute;ng &#273;&aacute;nh m&#7841;nh.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">B&#7841;n c&oacute; th&#7875; tham kh&#7843;o video b&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i &#273;&#7875; hi&#7875;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c c&aacute;ch setup &#273;&egrave;n khi ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m nh&eacute;.</p><p><iframe title="Portraits on clean white background: OnSet ep. #279" width="1170" height="658" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/68TTzBIxVdc?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p style="text-align: center;"><strong>H&#432;&#7899;ng d&#7851;n ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng cho Model</strong></p><h2 style="text-align: justify;"><span id="2_Hau_ky_chinh_level_highlightshadow_de_co_nen_sang">#2 H&#7853;u k&#7923; ch&#7881;nh level highlight/shadow &#273;&#7875; c&oacute; n&#7873;n s&aacute;ng</span></h2><p style="text-align: justify;">N&#7871;u trong tr&#432;&#7901;ng h&#7907;p b&#7841;n kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; &#273;&#7911; &#273;&egrave;n &#273;&#7875; &#273;&aacute;nh v&agrave;o background, ch&#7885;n c&aacute;ch x&#7917; l&yacute; b&#7857;ng photoshop nh&#432; n&agrave;y nh&eacute;.</p><ul><li style="text-align: justify;">B&#432;&#7899;c 1: M&#7903; t&#7845;m h&igrave;nh l&ecirc;n b&#7857;ng photoshop, &#273;i&#7873;u ch&#7881;nh &aacute;nh s&aacute;ng th&iacute;ch h&#7907;p t&#7915; camera raw</li><li style="text-align: justify;">B&#432;&#7899;c 2: Ch&#7885;n newlayer level, gi&#7919; ph&iacute;m Shift v&agrave; chu&#7897;t tr&aacute;i, k&eacute;o cho t&#7899;i khi th&#7845;y n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng c&#417; b&#7843;n</li><li style="text-align: justify;">B&#432;&#7899;c 3: V&agrave;o Image =&gt; Adjustment =&gt; Replace color (ch&#7885;n v&ugrave;ng m&agrave;u c&#7847;n chuy&#7875;n qua m&agrave;u tr&#7855;ng)</li></ul><p style="text-align: justify;">&#272;&#7875; hi&#7875;u r&otilde; h&#417;n b&#7841;n xem video b&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i nh&eacute;</p><p><iframe title="Create a Perfectly White Background in Photoshop FAST!" width="1170" height="658" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/OEokN2Ekdwk?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><iframe title="How to make White Background for Products in Photoshop" width="1170" height="658" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/9rRdcwfcJCo?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><h2 style="text-align: justify;"><span id="3_Tach_bo_san_pham_thay_nen_trang_cho_san_pham">#3 T&aacute;ch b&#7887; s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m, thay n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng cho s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m</span></h2><p style="text-align: justify;">C&aacute;ch n&agrave;y &aacute;p d&#7909;ng cho nh&#7919;ng s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m li&#7873;n kh&#7889;i, b&oacute;c t&aacute;ch d&#7877;. B&#7841;n h&atilde;y t&aacute;ch ri&ecirc;ng s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m ra th&agrave;nh 1 layer m&#7899;i v&agrave; sau &#273;&oacute; thay n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng cho background.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">C&aacute;ch n&agrave;y th&igrave; &#273;&#417;n gi&#7843;n, ai c&#361;ng l&agrave;m &#273;&#432;&#7907;c nh&#432;ng l&agrave;m h&#417;i l&acirc;u. B&#7841;n c&oacute; th&#7875; tham kh&#7843;o th&ecirc;m video b&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i nh&eacute;.</p><p><iframe title="How To White Background Perfectly in Photoshop for E Commerce Website I Photoshop editing" width="1170" height="658" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/d644SMuELZs?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p style="text-align: justify;">tr&ecirc;n &#273;&acirc;y l&agrave; 3 c&aacute;ch th&ocirc;ng th&#432;&#7901;ng nh&#7845;t &#273;&#7875; <a href="https://kingmedia.vn/bao-gia-chup-anh-san-pham-nen-trang/">ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng</a> tinh khi&#7871;t. T&ugrave;y v&agrave;o &#273;i&#7873;u ki&#7879;n m&agrave; ch&#7885;n ph&#432;&#417;ng ph&aacute;p n&agrave;o &#273;&#7875; ti&#7871;t ki&#7879;m th&#7901;i gian.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">Quan &#273;i&#7875;m c&#7911;a m&igrave;nh th&igrave; b&#7841;n b&ecirc;n ch&#7885;n c&aacute;ch 1, v&agrave; n&#7871;u trong tr&#432;&#7901;ng h&#7907;p c&aacute;ch 1 ch&#432;a &#273;&#7911; &#273;&#432;a n&#7873;n v&#7873; tr&#7855;ng tinh th&igrave; s&#7917; d&#7909;ng ti&#7871;p c&aacute;ch 2. Qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh x&#7917; l&yacute; photoshop s&#7869; cho ra 1 b&#7913;c &#7843;nh v&#7899;i n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng ho&agrave;n h&#7843;o.</p><p style="text-align: justify;">N&#7871;u b&#7841;n c&oacute; b&#7845;t k&#7923; c&acirc;u h&#7887;i n&agrave;o li&ecirc;n quan &#273;&#7871;n v&#7845;n &#273;&#7873; n&agrave;y, h&atilde;y comement b&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i ch&uacute;ng t&ocirc;i s&#7869; ph&#7843;n h&#7891;i h&#7895; tr&#7907; nh&eacute;.</p><p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Xem th&ecirc;m:</strong></p><ul><li><a href="https://hthaostudio.com/huong-dan-chup-anh-san-pham-dep-va-bat-mat-hthao-studio/">H&#432;&#7899;ng d&#7851;n ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m &#273;&#7865;p &amp; b&#7855;t m&#7855;t</a></li><li><a href="https://hthaostudio.com/bao-gia-chup-anh-san-pham-dep-chuyen-nghiep-tai-tp-hcm/">B&aacute;o gi&aacute; ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m t&#7841;i HThao Studio</a></li><li><a href="https://hthaostudio.com/tong-hop-anh-san-pham-dep-hthao-studio/">D&#7921; &aacute;n &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m b&#7903;i HThao Studio</a></li><li>Chuy&ecirc;n trang <a href="https://htmediagroup.vn/bao-gia-chup-anh-quang-cao-chuyen-nghiep-tai-tp-hcm-ht-media/">ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m</a>, <a href="https://htmediagroup.vn/bao-gia-chup-anh-quang-cao-chuyen-nghiep-tai-tp-hcm-ht-media/">ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh qu&#7843;ng c&aacute;o doanh nghi&#7879;p</a>: <a href="https://htmediagroup.vn/">HT Media Group</a></li><li><a href="https://kingmedia.vn/bao-gia-chup-anh-san-pham-nen-trang/">B&aacute;o gi&aacute; ch&#7909;p &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng</a> t&#7841;i c&#417; s&#7903; <a href="https://kingmedia.vn">King Media</a></li><li>Zalo li&ecirc;n h&#7879; h&#7895; tr&#7907;: <a href="https://zalo.me/0372130010">0372130010</a></li></ul><p><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>Album &#7843;nh s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m n&#7873;n tr&#7855;ng:</strong></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">[ts_image_gallery title=&rdquo;ALBUM &#7842;NH S&#7842;N PH&#7848;M N&#7872;N TR&#7854;NG &ndash; HTHAO STUDIO&rdquo; images=&rdquo;13594,13593,13595,13653,13652,13662,13664,13674,13673,13244,13243,13242,13203,13204,13206,13205&Prime; layout=&rdquo;grid&rdquo; columns=&